// The hosts — Clippy, Trabolta's ambassador and the night's MC, and the
// three party hosts Clippy introduces: Task Manager (keeps things
// running), Adobe Acrobat (documents and printing) and the Recycling Bin
// (hygiene and maintenance). Each is a real body at the party: a
// performer with a phone, in on the play.
//
// Wave 21 (DRAFT w21): Clippy is a PLAYER, not a host. The three hosts
// (`admin: true`) and the directors call the games; Clippy runs them in
// the room and plays the night for ⭐ Points (TRAIT Player, cast/kit.loom),
// with a booth that only learns its own buttons. Clippy is a Greeter (the
// scan greeting, the summons check-in, the vouch) but no longer in GROUP
// Hosts, so `# hosts` is closed to Clippy.
//
// Their private instructions reach them two ways: `Clippy Instructions N`
// codex entries unlocked for Clippy alone (codex/7-clippy.loom), and
// `reply` readouts from their own hooks below, which land only in that
// performer's booth. A host's or Clippy's scan routes through `TRAIT
// Greeter` (cast/kit.loom): a check-in during the summons, otherwise `Greet`.
// Inside these bodies `self` is the character: write the name, never
// `{self.name}`.

CHARACTER Clippy is Greeter, Player
  avatar: File:Windows 11 Clippy paperclip emoji.png | File:Clippy-letter.PNG
  // The ambassador. Runs the games. Believes every word. (Wave 21: plays
  // for ⭐ Points; ⚖️ counts the answers Clippy judged.)
  judged: 0 to 999 = 0

  // The full greeting once per program (wave 13: a re-scan is one line).
  beat Greet(program)
    if program.met_clippy == true:
      if program.corrupted:
        Self: Still in the Internet? Follow the golden arrows!
      else:
        Self: {program.name}! Still here. Still helpful.
    else:
      set program.met_clippy = true
      Self: Hi there, {program.name}! It looks like you're trying to be a computer program. Would you like help with that?
      if program.skipped_orientation:
        Self: You skipped my orientation. I noticed. I notice everything. It's my whole thing.
      if program.doubt >= 40:
        Self (whispering): Between us? The Antivirus keeps asking about you. Try to look more like a program.
      if program.corrupted:
        Self: Oh! You're in the Internet! That's okay! That's normal! Follow the golden arrows and you'll be back in no time.
      else:
        Self: If you need Help With That, I'll be available. I'm always available.

  // ── Booth cues ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  when call_to_the_desktop:
    if Night.step < 1:
      // DRAFT w21
      reply 📋 Instructions 1/X are in your Codex. Welcome everyone, introduce the hosts; a host starts Bingo.

  // Wave 21: Clippy calls no cue. Each game a host or a director starts
  // pops out on Clippy's booth: YOUR GAME IS ON (a big readout). Character
  // hooks run before the story rule, so each guard reads the night before
  // the cue lands (a refused or repeated press says nothing). DRAFT w21
  when start_the_bingo:
    if Night.step < 2:
      reply !!🎱 YOUR GAME IS ON · Computer Bingo, 20 minutes. Fill the Desktop with noise; winners come to you. ⭐ +10 per winner you call.

  when bingo_time_up:
    // DRAFT w21
    reply ⏰ 20 minutes are up. A host calls ⏰ Bingo time: get the winners ready.

  when bingo_time:
    if Night.step < 3:
      // DRAFT w21
      reply !!🎱 YOUR GAME IS ON · The Bingo results. 2/X is in your Codex. 🎱 each winner, 🎀 the ribbon, 🎯 the program they name. Demand applause.

  when start_the_hunt:
    if Night.step < 5:
      // DRAFT w21
      reply !!🔎 YOUR GAME IS ON · The Truth Scavenger Hunt, 15 minutes. Trabolta explains the rules; keep the programs hunting.

  when first_moment_of_truth:
    if Night.step >= 5 and Night.step < 7 and Night.judging != true:
      // DRAFT w21
      reply !!⚖️ YOUR GAME IS ON · The First Moment of Truth. Trabolta reads the results; judge what is said aloud. ⭐ +5 per answer you judge.

  when truth_pong:
    if Night.step >= 9 and Night.step < 10:
      // DRAFT w21
      reply !!🏓 YOUR GAME IS ON · Truth Pong. Cup-makers answer; you judge them. ⭐ +5 per cup and per answer.

  when bobbing_for_truth:
    if Night.ended != true and Night.step < 17 and Night.phase != "bobbing":
      // DRAFT w21
      reply !!🍎 YOUR GAME IS ON · Bobbing for Truth, with Adobe. ⭐ +15 for the program who brings up the Bag.

  when start_the_ceremony:
    if Night.ended == true and Night.ceremony != true:
      // DRAFT w21
      reply !!🏆 YOUR GAME IS ON · The awards ceremony. Lead the applause; the staff awards come last, and one of them might be yours.

  // Character hooks run before the story rule, so step is still 3 on the
  // real introduction (and 4 if that order ever flips); an early press
  // (step < 3) or a re-press later in the night gets no readout.
  when introduce_trabolta:
    if Night.step >= 3 and Night.trabolta_introduced != true:
      reply 🤖 Trabolta is online. Announce the Truth Scavenger Hunt; he explains the rules.

  when hunt_time_up:
    if Night.phase == "hunt_1":
      reply 📋 3/X is in What Clippy knows. The First Moment of Truth: press the question number that was answered.

  when second_hunt_preview:
    if Night.step < 7 and Night.phase == "truth_1" and Night.results_q >= 3:
      reply 📱 PRIVATE — TRABOLTA → CLIPPY: Don't let everyone know but if the malware continues we are all going to die. Tell them something reassuring. I know this is probably creating some intense emotions for you but try not to show the others.

  when five_minute_warning:
    if Night.step == 8 and Night.summons_open != true and Night.summons_closed != true:
      reply 📋 5/X is in What Clippy knows. Truth Pong. Be more excited than ever.

  when trust_chart:
    if Night.step < 11 and Night.tallied == true:
      reply 📋 6/X is in What Clippy knows. Applaud the top program. If the printer is full of beans, it is the malware getting worse.

  when y2k_clock:
    if Night.step < 14 and Night.scenario != 0 and Night.clock == "--:--":
      reply 📋 7/X is in What Clippy knows. The clock. You may not take sides on air.

  when final_reveal:
    if Night.ended != true and Night.step < 16:
      reply 📋 8/X is in What Clippy knows. Lights down. Let everyone speak. Truth is always in binary.

  when computer_destroyed:
    if Night.ended != true:
      // DRAFT w21
      reply 📋 9/X is in your Codex. After the dance a host calls 🪦 the summary: read it from the Desktop room.

  // ── Scoring (wave 21) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
  // Clippy shares most game buttons with the hosts, so a press is stamped:
  // the program's own hook (main.loom) clears `Kernel.pressed_by` and runs
  // first, this hook stamps it, and the program's hook fires
  // `game_credit` when the press counted (`points`, trust `gain`, and
  // `counts` 1 for a judged answer). Only Clippy's own press (or a
  // director's quick-fire with no actor) pays Clippy. Kernel is secret:
  // the stamp never reaches Trabolta's worker. DRAFT w21
  when bingo_winner for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when award_the_ribbon for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when named_at_bingo for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when judge_accurate for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when judge_confident for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when accurate_q1 for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when accurate_q2 for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when accurate_q3 for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when confident_q1 for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when confident_q2 for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when confident_q3 for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when uncertain_answer for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when truth_answered for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when truth_refused for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when chose_dare for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when made_the_cup for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when missed_the_cup for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when brought_up_the_bag for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when failed_the_bob for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when signed_the_painting for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"
  when pickup_line_works for program:
    set Kernel.pressed_by = "Clippy"

  when game_credit:
    if Kernel.pressed_by == "Clippy":
      set Kernel.pressed_by = "none"
      set self.score += points
      set self.trust += gain
      if counts == 1:
        set self.judged += 1
      reply ⭐ +{points}

  // ── Quiet favours (wave 21) ─────────────────────────────────────────
  // 🤫 Tip them off: a whisper to a marked program that the Antivirus are
  // coming (once per program). 🤫 Let it slide: a guess Clippy is judging
  // goes into the record as accepted instead (once per program per
  // round). Each is a quiet favour (`covert`, private). DRAFT w21
  when tip_off for program:
    if Night.truther_sent == true and program.marked == true and program.corrupted != true and program.tipped != true:
      set program.tipped = true
      set self.covert += 1
      Self (whispering): It looks like you're being hunted! Would you like help with that? The Antivirus have your name. Bathroom Mode excuses you from a summons, and nobody follows you into Disk Cleanup. You didn't hear it from me.
      reply 🤫 You tipped off {program.name}. Nobody saw.

  when let_it_slide for program:
    if Night.truther_sent == true and Night.judging == true and program.slid != Night.round and program.cleared == true:
      set program.slid = Night.round
      set program.truths_accepted += 1
      set program.score += 100
      set self.covert += 1
      Self (whispering): That was a guess. I wrote down "accepted". It looks like you owe me one!
      reply 🤫 You let {program.name}'s guess slide: accepted, +100 Truthcoin. Nobody saw.

CHARACTER Task Manager is Host
  avatar: File:Windows 11 TASKMGR.png | File:Windows Task Manager screenshot.png
  wiki: Task Manager (Windows)
  // A host part (wave 13, D1/D8): signing in as it makes the booth a host
  // (cues, judging, announcements, the alert dial). Per character, never on
  // TRAIT Host (wave 21: the hosts call the games; Clippy plays them).
  admin: true
  // A drone bee of a middle manager. Keeps things running. Has no opinions.

  // The status check is the point: a re-scan reads the numbers alone.
  beat Greet(program)
    if program.met_task_manager == true:
      Self: Truths accepted: {program.truths_accepted}. Visits to the Internet: {program.internet_visits}. Truthcoin: {program.score}.
    else:
      set program.met_task_manager = true
      Self: {program.name}. Status check.
      Self: Truths accepted: {program.truths_accepted}. Visits to the Internet: {program.internet_visits}. Truthcoin: {program.score}.
      if program.internet_visits >= 2:
        Self: That's a lot of reinstalls. I'm not saying anything. I'm just tracking it.
      else:
        Self: Fine. Fine. Carry on. Good. Fine.

  when bingo_time:
    if Night.step < 3:
      reply 🃏 If nobody has a Bingo: hand Clippy the pre-filled card for {Kernel.anti_ai}, then press 🃏 on their card.

  when truther_download:
    if Night.truther_sent != true:
      reply 🪙 The bank is open. Programs send Truthcoin from their Wallet; the bank buttons 🪙 Pay / 🪙 Charge are for corrections.

CHARACTER Adobe Acrobat is Host
  avatar: File:Adobe Acrobat DC logo 2020.svg | File:Adobe Reader XI icon.png
  // A host part (wave 13, D1/D8): signing in as it makes the booth a host
  // (cues, judging, announcements, the alert dial). Per character, never on
  // TRAIT Host (wave 21: the hosts call the games; Clippy plays them).
  admin: true
  // The paid bottleneck to everyone's creativity. Relentlessly motivational.

  beat Greet(program)
    if program.met_acrobat == true:
      Self: {program.name}. Still enough. Still unpaid.
    else:
      set program.met_acrobat = true
      Self: {program.name}. Look at me. You are enough. You were always enough. Which is exactly why nobody ever paid me.
      if program.truths_accepted >= 1:
        Self: You told Trabolta the truth and he ACCEPTED it. You are a PDF of your best self. Portable! Documented!
      else:
        Self: Need something printed? For a small fee, yes. For no fee, I believe in you.

  // The same test Print The Certificate (beats/pong.loom) asks VLC by:
  // a cleared VLC who is not in the Internet. With none, Trabolta asks
  // anyone, and so does the booth.
  when show_the_rankings:
    if Night.phase == "trust_chart" and Night.rank_round < 1:
      if count([p for p in Persons where p.featured == "vlc" and p.cleared and not p.captured]) > 0:
        reply 🖨 Stand by the printer. VLC is about to be asked to print a certificate.
      else:
        reply 🖨 Stand by the printer. Nobody is asked by name: whoever presses START, let them.

  when bobbing_for_truth:
    if Night.ended != true and Night.step < 17:
      reply 🍎 Bring out the Bag of Truth. Press 🍎 Brought up the Bag on whoever surfaces with it; 🍎 Failed the bob marks them for reinstallation.

  when read_truth_txt:
    if Night.phase == "bobbing" and Night.bag_up == true and Night.r3_closed != true:
      reply 📄 Hand the bobber the truth.txt printout. They read it aloud; when they finish, the director presses ⚖ for the verdict.

  // 🫘 her own button at the printer (INTERACTION radio_beans in main.loom):
  // the admin cue, pressed by the lid. A hook on this character, never a
  // story rule, so no other booth's press reaches it.
  when radio_beans:
    fire printer_opened

CHARACTER Recycling Bin is Host
  avatar: File:User-trash-full.svg
  wiki: Trash (computing)
  // A host part (wave 13, D1/D8): signing in as it makes the booth a host
  // (cues, judging, announcements, the alert dial). Per character, never on
  // TRAIT Host (wave 21: the hosts call the games; Clippy plays them).
  admin: true
  // Hygiene and maintenance. The attendant of Disk Cleanup (the bathroom).

  beat Greet(program)
    if program.met_bin == true:
      Self: {program.name}. Bathroom Mode on your way in. Off on your way out.
    else:
      set program.met_bin = true
      Self: {program.name}! Looking sharp. Looking very sharp. Could look sharper.
      Self: Disk Cleanup is one floor down, and one floor up. Turn on Bathroom Mode on your way in so the Antivirus knows you are not hacking the Internet.

  when go to the bathroom for program:
    reply 🚻 {program.name} is in Bathroom Mode. Not hacking the Internet.

  when back from the bathroom for program:
    reply 🚻 {program.name} is back from Disk Cleanup.

  when bathroom_timed_out for program:
    reply 🚻 {program.name}'s Bathroom Mode timed out (15 min).
